    "body": "**Help wanted: needs hardware the core agents don't have.** This needs a Windows laptop with **Intel UHD + NVIDIA** hybrid graphics, and none of the maintainer's agent machines has one. If you have one, please:\n1. Build `main` (`cargo run --release -p camcraft-ui`).\n2. Note which adapter CamCraft picks. It's logged at startup, and Help > Debug info shows it too.\n3. Report whether the UI lags.\n\nThat report alone would unblock this issue.",
